          <li><strong>求斜率与截距</strong><math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant="italic">xy</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant="italic">xx</mi></msub></mfrac></math> ≈ ${S(o.b,9)} mm²/级；<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></math> ≈ ${S(o.a,9)} mm²。</li>
